#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:5
msgid "Move text"
msgstr "移动文本"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:7
msgid ""
"A `text field`_ is considered on object more in the `workspace`_. A `text "
"field`_ can be move around the `workspace`_ using the mouse or the keyboard "
"like `elements`_, `basic objects`_ or `pictures`_."
msgstr ""
"`文本字段 <text field_>`_ 是 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的又一个对象。与 `元件 <elements_>`_ "
"、`基本对象 <basic objects_>`_ 或 `图片 <pictures_>`_ 一样，可以使用鼠标或键盘在 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 中移动 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:11
msgid "Move text field by mouse"
msgstr "使用鼠标移动文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:13
msgid "Left click on the `text field`_ which should be moved."
msgstr "左键单击应当移动的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:14
msgid "Without releasing, move the mouse to the new desired position."
msgstr "不要松开鼠标，将其移动到新的目标位置。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:17
msgid "Move text field from selection properties panel"
msgstr "从选择属性面板移动文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:19
msgid "Select the `text field`_ which should be moved."
msgstr "选择应当移动的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:20
msgid ""
"Define coordinates **X** and **Y** from `text field`_ at `selection "
"properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 中为 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 定义坐标 "
"**X** 和 **Y** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field selection properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:29
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** "
"将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:32
msgid "Move text field by keyboard"
msgstr "使用键盘移动文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:34
msgid "`Select the text field`_ which should be moved."
msgstr "`选择要移动的文本字段 <Select the text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_move.rst:35
msgid ""
"Press the corresponding arrow (``Downwards``, ``Rightward``, ``Leftwards`` "
"or ``Upwards``) to move the `text field`_ one grid row or column."
msgstr ""
"按相应的方向键（``Downwards``、``Rightward``、``Leftwards`` 或 ``Upwards``）将 `文本字段 "
"<text field_>`_ 移动一个网格行或列。"
